  "releaseNotes": "v3.5.15: OPFS writable abort-on-throw - FileSystemFileHandle/FileSystemDirectoryHandle Write/Append/WriteJSON and the Stream copy path now Abort() the createWritable() stream on a mid-write throw (e.g. QuotaExceededError) instead of leaking its swap file. New WriteAndCommit helper + FileSystemHandleWritableStream.AbortAsync. Fixes an OPFS storage-exhaustion runaway. See CHANGELOG.md.",
